<https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/2026-10-20T042039Z-commercial-operations-assembly> a prov:Activity , dct:ProvenanceStatement ;
  rdfs:label "Commercial Operations 0.2.0 and the first Sales assembly, 2026-10-20T04:20:39Z"@en ;
  dct:description "Commercial Operations container 0.2.0, Sales 0.2.0 and Pricing and contracts 0.2.0, the other domains 0.1.1, and the first Sales assembly (design decisions D17–D22). Census moved from pricing and contracts to the container. Sales gained the Sales service class and taxonomy branch and the step and record kinds of two services. Every domain ontology now names the plain core and container ontology IRIs in owl:imports and pins their versions in dcterms:requires. The assembly adds the PEO buyer persona graph (2 personas, 6 jobs, 28 job steps, 84 desired outcomes from the KE Workbench buyer persona tool), the standard selling process graph, five step graphs, the service graphs for total cost of employment analysis and benefits comparison, and the Sales assembly 0.2.0 manifest. Built by build_domains.py and build_assembly.py against Baseline Core v1.0 (core 0.1.0), which was read and not changed; 0 errors; the shapes were run over the assembled data."@en ;
  dct:creator "Jeffrey Wallk" ;
  dct:contributor "Claude (AI assistant), at the direction of Jeffrey Wallk" ;
  prov:startedAtTime "2026-10-20T04:20:39Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
